#N canvas 40 40 760 780 12;
#X text 20 20 Cut It -- entry point on the Organelle. mother.pd loads this file by name. Keep it thin: it instantiates u_root and nothing else., f 52;
#X obj 20 120 u_root 17 1 /sdcard/cut-it-state 33 49;
#X text 20 250 THE FIVE ARGUMENTS ARE A CONTRACT \, and both entry points have to keep it. What each one is \, why arg 3 differs between the Mac and the device \, and why a wrong count loads in SILENCE are on ref/architecture.md under Creation arguments. ⚠️ Pd 0.49 does not warn about a missing or extra argument and positional args cannot be skipped \, so every m_ layer prints the channel it actually got., f 52;
#X text 20 170 The Mac entry point is main-dev.pd \, which adds u_mother-stub. It ships in this folder and the device never loads it., f 52;
